== bag borrow-own-field-mutated
BYN3002 35:16 `inner` does not live as long as `kept`, which borrows it |`inner` is freed at the end of its block|copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough|
BYN3004 26:5 `lexer` is modified while `all` still borrows it |`all` is used again on line 28|finish using `all` first, or copy what it needs before changing `lexer`|
